thenticate: `pac auth create --environment <env-url>`", "Run: `pac package deploy --package <path-to-package.dll> --logConsole --verbose`"], "expected_result": null, "actual_result": "The deployment hangs indefinitely. The process never completes, never errors, and never times out. The main thread blocks forever on an internal `ManualResetEventSlim.Wait()` inside `pac`'s own deployment code, waiting for a signal that is never sent. All other threads in the process are completely idle — there is no background work in progress anywhere.", "is_regression": null}, "error": null}
